MoroIsland_Museum2_Text_1:
	.string "We are part of the research team\n"
	.string "of MORO ISLAND MUSEUM.\p"
	.string "I’m more of a theoretical\n"
	.string "researcher than a practical one,\l"
	.string "that’s why I’m working here.\p"
	.string "Another part of our team is on\n"
	.string "expedition to FUKUHARA ISLAND at\l"
	.string "the moment.$"

MoroIsland_Museum2_Text_2:
	.string "Wherever we go, I always try to\n"
	.string "educate my daughter by going to\l"
	.string "local museums.$"

MoroIsland_Museum2_Text_3:
	.string "My dad gave me such a nice PIKACHU\n"
	.string "to take care of!$"

MoroIsland_Museum2_Text_4:
	.string "...\n"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "You’re surprised to see someone\n"
	.string "like me in a museum?\p"
	.string "You shouldn’t judge people on how\n"
	.string "they look, you know.$"

MoroIsland_Museum2_Text_5:
	.string "At first sight, most stones will\n"
	.string "look useless.\p"
	.string "Some stones are said to make\n"
	.string "certain types of POKéMON evolve,\l"
	.string "however.$"

MoroIsland_Museum2_Text_6:
	.string "An incomplete POKéMON Fossil\n"
	.string "It’s incomplete, so unidentified.$"

MoroIsland_Museum2_Text_7:
	.string "An incomplete POKéMON Fossil\n"
	.string "It’s incomplete, so unidentified.$"

MoroIsland_Museum2_Text_8:
	.string "A couple of odd looking stones are\n"
	.string "on display.$"
